@startuml
title Save Scenario: Persist a Generation as a Text File

actor Player
participant "CLI Command Handler" as Command
participant "CLI Grid File I/O" as Files
participant "Game Engine Text Codec" as Codec
participant "File System" as FS
participant "CLI Terminal Presenter" as Presenter

autonumber

Player -> Command: request save
Command -> Files: save current grid
Files -> Codec: format grid as text
Codec --> Files: grid text
Files -> FS: write plain text file
FS --> Files: write confirmed
Files --> Command: save result
Command -> Presenter: report result
Presenter --> Player: confirmation or clear error message

note right of FS
The Web UI path differs: the page sends its grid text and a file name to Flask, which writes to grids/. See sequence-webui-save.
end note
@enduml
